Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Pineapple, Host, February
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.45,Default,lily,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:09.06,Default,lily,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:16.53,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.43,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that the great Jang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:23.20,Default,lily,0,0,0,,you need such a thing to maintain life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:27.54,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Life is so worthless, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:31.71,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I was really motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:34.92,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Can I become the local \NSteve Jobs or Thomas Edison?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:37.28,Default,lily,0,0,0,,No, I'm taking it low. We need someone great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.15,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Savior of the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:51.50,Default,lily,0,0,0,,In the queen’s body sits,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:56.30,Default,lily,0,0,0,,which should not be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:58.11,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:03.98,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The Queen is possessed by an evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.31,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I can’t leave you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.38,0:02:09.78,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Go away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:19.76,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Exactly, Carrier! Inventor of air conditioners!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:26.27,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:29.37,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Come to your senses, Your Majesty! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.84,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:39.68,Default,lily,0,0,0,,7 episode: Mask
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.58,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Charge for 100 joules.\N-Move away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:45.15,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Add epinephrine. Charge for 150 joules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:47.65,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Charge for 150 joules.\N-Move away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:58.00,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Live.\N-I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:02.24,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Isn’t this the queen’s servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:06.11,Default,lily,0,0,0,,And the royal doctor is running after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.51,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-What happened?\N-Her Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:27.36,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:28.80,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.60,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:37.97,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it, I'm nagging you for your own good...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.97,0:03:39.64,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.11,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:45.65,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:48.65,Default,lily,0,0,0,,They have already left for the royal physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:50.45,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:53.22,Default,lily,0,0,0,,You can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:56.19,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Don’t leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.76,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I won't grumble at you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:02.33,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Come to your senses, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.87,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.57,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:10.57,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Hanguk University Hospital, Jang Bong Hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:12.17,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Charge for 100 joules.\N-Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:13.61,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Move away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.18,Default,lily,0,0,0,,150 joules, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:22.88,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-He's back.\N-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.62,Default,lily,0,0,0,,How bright. What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:27.85,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Pulse is normal. Pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.32,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The pressure is also normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:32.66,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Hospital? Am I back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:34.56,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Back. The truth is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.56,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Jang Bong-hwan, you were dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.77,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.60,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I thought I would be locked in a female body for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.14,Default,lily,0,0,0,,How many days have passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.01,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Exactly. How many days did I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.61,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The body is so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.14,Default,lily,0,0,0,,A week has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.41,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Time passed the same way as in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:51.81,Default,lily,0,0,0,,First, help me get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:54.25,Default,lily,0,0,0,,He was unconscious for a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.18,Default,lily,0,0,0,,now in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:59.19,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What does it mean in a vegetative state?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.52,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Hey Dr. Lee, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:04.63,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What a vegetative state, am I normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:05.76,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.83,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Watch him.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.43,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.57,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Come back! I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.14,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m like a cucumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:18.54,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What? Can't anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:21.21,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I'm here. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.91,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Jang Bong Hwan is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:26.65,Default,lily,0,0,0,,When will the healer come?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.32,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.35,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.62,Default,lily,0,0,0,,My queen, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.32,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:40.26,Default,lily,0,0,0,,She suddenly jumped up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:43.13,Default,lily,0,0,0,,then she turned pale and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.97,Default,lily,0,0,0,,How could she fall out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.40,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Probably poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:50.40,Default,lily,0,0,0,,She could have been poisoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.87,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:55.71,Default,lily,0,0,0,,This can’t be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:57.31,Default,lily,0,0,0,,We carefully monitor the products,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.05,Default,lily,0,0,0,,outsiders are not allowed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:02.38,Default,lily,0,0,0,,and the queen didn’t eat anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.02,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Then what was she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.75,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Did you cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.79,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:12.89,Default,lily,0,0,0,,She could have gotten poison
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.46,Default,lily,0,0,0,,tasting the dishes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:19.07,Default,lily,0,0,0,,You can’t be sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.43,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Otolopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.60,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I was always afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.61,Default,lily,0,0,0,,that something like this will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:29.28,Default,lily,0,0,0,,And finally it happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:32.45,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Has she really been poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:35.38,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.42,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I'll take a look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:38.92,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Don’t hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.97,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Pulse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:55.10,Default,lily,0,0,0,,not like a living one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:57.27,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:09.92,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.45,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Vegetative state?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:17.69,Default,lily,0,0,0,,A person cannot move and is like a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.73,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Her blood and qi\Nenergy gathered in the upper part of her body,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:25.37,Default,lily,0,0,0,,the spirit has left the body, and she hardly breathes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:29.14,Default,lily,0,0,0,,If the chi energy returns, she will survive. If not -
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.21,Default,lily,0,0,0,,she will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.38,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What does it mean to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.85,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What can I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.35,Default,lily,0,0,0,,what to do to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:48.09,Default,lily,0,0,0,,You need to pour hibiscus decoction and calamus juice into her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.46,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.09,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Bring everything immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:52.49,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.86,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Will the Queen hold out until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:57.73,Default,lily,0,0,0,,That’s the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:00.83,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Don’t just stand there, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:03.44,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Save our queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:07.27,Default,lily,0,0,0,,To do something, you need to move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:13.08,Default,lily,0,0,0,,We go to the Daejojon hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:15.92,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.08,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:22.02,Default,lily,0,0,0,,We need to expel the evil spirit from the queen’s body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:24.16,Default,lily,0,0,0,,You can’t hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:27.23,Default,lily,0,0,0,,And how to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:29.90,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Let's place scary objects around the Daejojon hall\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.90,Default,lily,0,0,0,,and block the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.84,Default,lily,0,0,0,,And then we will perform the ritual of exorcising the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.54,Default,lily,0,0,0,,This is dangerous. Such a ritual cannot be performed in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:40.01,Default,lily,0,0,0,,If we get caught...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:43.01,Default,lily,0,0,0,,It is pointless to carry out the ritual outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:47.41,Default,lily,0,0,0,,In order for the ritual to be successful, perform it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:49.38,Default,lily,0,0,0,,needed near the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.90,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.40,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:07.13,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-Finished?\N-Yes, everything is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.42,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:25.12,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The patient had a cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.45,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Listen. Here. Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:29.02,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:33.46,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Did he say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:36.23,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Yes. Can you hear? I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:39.37,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I hear and see everything, I’m not a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.10,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.40,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Is he really talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:44.60,Default,lily,0,0,0,,He is falsely accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:46.81,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Hey dumbass, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:49.84,Default,lily,0,0,0,,-I hear you, moron.\N-I’m sure he feels that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.31,Default,lily,0,0,0,,He is in the midst of a scandal between Khan\N and the Prime Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.31,0:09:53.75,Default,lily,0,0,0,,and is going to take all the blame on himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.22,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.92,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The tricks of Director Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:08.70,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Start treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.47,Default,lily,0,0,0,,He seems crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.74,Default,lily,0,0,0,,but it’s unlikely to be able to pin everything on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:20.37,Default,lily,0,0,0,,What can he do? He's a loser anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.74,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The best way out for him is to lie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.41,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Are you serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:27.55,Default,lily,0,0,0,,In my place would they lie and suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:30.08,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Can detectives say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:34.02,Default,lily,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:37.79,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I'll put my life on the line and get acupuncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.94,Default,lily,0,0,0,,I won’t let him get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:58.78,Default,lily,0,0,0,,The villain Director Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:04.15,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Holy Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:07.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, I’ll bite his backbone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you forgetting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:18.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.93,0:11:20.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:21.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:25.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You already ate so much, \Nforgetting to be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:28.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you going to snack on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:39.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The worst is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:43.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But why didn’t she wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen breathes again,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:48.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but she hasn’t fully come to her senses yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:51.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We have to keep an eye on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:54.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the queen may get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:57.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In other words, it's not over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:00.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,everything will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:14.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The king went to Daejojong Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.79,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen lost consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:22.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,he wants to stay by her bedside and look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:30.60,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Worth changing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I said everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Find out who, your life will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:13.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Of course, I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:23.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that this maiden\Nis subordinate to the court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:26.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Everything comes together just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:31.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I knew it, the spirits are on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:33.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Queen Mother, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:47.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I want to perform a ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,here, I’m getting ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:52.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Nothing serious, so have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.59,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I know about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:03.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You asked your father to spare the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:06.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That time you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:10.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,that I don’t have to act alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-True.\N-But what
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,if I want to do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:18.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:22.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,can I surpass the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:50.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll stay all night, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:54.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It's late, I'm afraid how you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:56.55,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,they didn’t get sick either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:58.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:01.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:02.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:18.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I haven't had a single quiet day here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:22.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The husband with whom I share the same blanket is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:25.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You will feel numb,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:26.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,don’t hesitate and hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:30.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I summoned the courage to apologize,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:32.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and this is what I get in response?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Listen, if only the one who needs an apology is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,who apologizes, not the one who receives them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.76,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,is this an apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:42.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The moment is lost. There's no point in saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I was hoping
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:50.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,that I will have a chance to understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:01.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is a very expensive fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:04.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If I used it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I would remember for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:08.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:12.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,They brought you silk to make
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:14.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,silk flowers for a banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.69,0:16:15.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:19.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And you don't have any excess fabric left?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:25.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,chief in the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:28.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim Moon-geun, took the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:37.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Was there a similar one among that fabric?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:02.18,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I saw him burn something valuable,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:05.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,found it suspicious and took it out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:10.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:20.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Does the king really have something to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:22.66,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:24.06,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Queen Mother and Concubine Cho
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:26.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,are they performing a ritual together within the walls of the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.37,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I thought the royal concubine had enough brains not to get involved in this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.67,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but she seems to be the same as the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That’s even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:40.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can teach these crazy people a good lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you reprimand them for the ritual
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:44.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and talismans, rumors will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:47.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But they won’t stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:53.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I wish I could do \Nsomething more substantial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.93,0:17:58.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is the chief eunuch! I have urgent news!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:07.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:12.18,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The queen lost her breath, she is unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:15.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Lost breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:18.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The healer gave her back her breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:20.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but she needs to be watched all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:23.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.02,0:18:28.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,There is a suspicion that the queen was poisoned while cooking in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:38.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:45.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:16.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you want to fight with all your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:22.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,if you want to defeat her with all your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:27.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,then from now on\Nyou shouldn't have secrets from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:37.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Then tell me if it's worth it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:45.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,does the king know what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The King wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:01.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,the same as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:18.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Is she breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:25.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Breathes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:27.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But if she is sleeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:30.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,why is she so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:36.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What is it? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:38.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:42.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You always wanted a daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,are you happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:50.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You are in pain, you are suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:53.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You must be missing your mother even more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:17.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You can handle everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:21.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get well soon,\Nto be full of strength and energy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:25.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You promised me to live\Nfollowing the social distancing rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:30.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will forgive you and your strange speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and impudent behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.59,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Just wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:01.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you haven't left yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:05.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The queen is in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.58,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Has she stopped breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.58,0:22:11.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the doctor returned it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.29,0:22:15.79,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I want you to go to Seongwonjong Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.89,0:22:19.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Someone wants to harm the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:23.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We will strike \Nthe Queen Mother and Concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.34,0:22:34.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Go away, evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:37.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Gods, listen to my prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:42.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Cast out the evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:52.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How dare you break in here?\NDon’t you know what this place is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You think you can get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:09.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll ask you the same thing.\NDo you think it's a threat to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.41,0:23:11.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,queen you can get away with?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-What is it?\N-Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:18.15,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-What are you doing?\N-Search everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What a horror! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.49,0:23:23.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Oh no!\N-What a horror!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:29.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I prayed for a peaceful life in the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:39.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This rat was found near the Daejojeon Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:43.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:46.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that the shaman acted alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:52.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It seems your gods haven't told you when you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:57.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It will happen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.69,0:24:03.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please, spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.83,0:24:08.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I was just following the Queen Mother's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:15.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will perform a ritual that will break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:18.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Ritual that will break the curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.95,0:24:23.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You serve God, not your king!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:25.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Apparently you decided that the palace is a circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.35,0:24:26.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Everything is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:28.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Late.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.25,0:24:30.76,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The queen's life is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.56,0:24:33.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:35.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You performed the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.73,0:24:38.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And now you don’t believe in its consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:41.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You have been deceived by a scammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.23,0:24:43.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Look where this led!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.77,0:24:46.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Because of you, the reputation of the entire dynasty has come to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.47,0:24:48.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you tried to kill the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:49.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and also committed a serious crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.61,0:24:51.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,confusing us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:54.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How are you going to pay for your sins?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.02,0:25:00.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,May I know the queen's condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.12,0:25:04.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Pretending you don't know the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:07.43,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you what happened to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:09.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,She was poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:13.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Arsenic was found among the products in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:17.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Arsenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.54,0:25:22.04,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know what kind of poison this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:33.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.19,0:25:37.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you know more about her than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:42.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And again you are back to the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.60,0:25:46.70,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Once again you accuse me of killing the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:53.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,People are fools who quickly forget about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.61,0:25:58.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Not knowing how valuable a life saved at the cost of the life of your own child is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.78,0:26:05.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That time it was you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.75,0:26:08.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,begged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.49,0:26:10.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Instead of investigating the death of the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.92,0:26:12.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,poisoned with arsenic,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.39,0:26:15.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you asked me for your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:19.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And what do I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.40,0:26:23.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You lured the innocent concubine Cho into your dirty rituals and tried to poison the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.37,0:26:26.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Aren’t you ashamed of the deceased king?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.74,0:26:29.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Although why be surprised, if you had a conscience,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.84,0:26:32.48,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,you would have died after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.71,0:26:37.02,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Apologizing is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.78,0:26:41.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You know more than anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:43.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,how much I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Since you think so, I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.56,0:26:47.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I order
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.19,0:26:51.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,quarter the shaman and the court lady Khan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.96,0:26:53.37,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.10,0:27:00.57,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:03.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.71,0:27:06.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,As for the Queen Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.21,0:27:09.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.72,0:27:13.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.05,0:27:17.76,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.76,0:27:20.36,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Prayers will not help you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.36,0:27:24.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How long should I turn a blind eye to your misdeeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:27.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You won’t get off that easy this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.53,0:27:29.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:32.47,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please give me a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.47,0:27:34.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,atone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:38.28,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How are you going to atone for such a grave sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.81,0:27:44.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You must be sure
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:47.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,that the king
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:51.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,submits to you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.06,0:27:54.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You were sure that the deceased king was in your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:58.46,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,therefore, they resigned as regent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.56,0:28:00.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:12.98,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Are the words of the Queen Mother disturbing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.95,0:28:21.15,Default,fe,0,0,0,,For your peace of mind, I’ll check,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.09,0:28:24.32,Default,fe,0,0,0,,what kind of person is His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:35.77,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:39.81,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:49.28,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:51.45,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I'm translating the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:54.42,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Transporting?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:56.59,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:59.02,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I can’t tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.20,0:29:14.51,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Can’t tell me where you’re taking the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.31,0:29:20.31,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.81,0:29:22.41,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Mask of lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.41,0:29:26.62,Default,fe,0,0,0,,The queen was cursed in Seongwonjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:28.45,Default,fe,0,0,0,,It was the Queen Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.99,0:29:31.09,Default,fe,0,0,0,,and royal concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.06,0:29:36.13,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:40.10,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that the reason for the queen’s illness is a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.97,0:29:43.77,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Arsenic was found in the royal kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:51.84,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Now the investigation will be conducted by the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.08,0:29:54.91,Default,fe,0,0,0,,In this regard, I have questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.18,0:29:58.48,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What and where did you do with Prince Yeonpyeong
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.98,0:30:02.52,Default,fe,0,0,0,,the night after the royal wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.42,0:30:07.09,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What are you allowing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.23,0:30:09.73,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Show your real face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.73,0:30:12.16,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Apparently your memory is failing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.97,0:30:16.47,Default,fe,0,0,0,,If this is the case, I will have to formally interrogate the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.11,0:30:23.01,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Not a step further!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.88,0:30:28.31,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.22,0:30:41.66,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Please do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:46.33,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Otherwise your guards will have to\Ndisrespect and harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.68,0:31:05.25,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:07.92,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This is the king's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.52,0:31:14.23,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This is my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.40,0:31:19.60,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Touch her with even a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.10,0:31:22.77,Default,fe,0,0,0,,and this sword will cut your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.21,0:31:34.11,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that the queen was so dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.45,0:31:36.85,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You don’t know a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:40.29,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Let me teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.93,0:31:56.67,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Can you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.37,0:32:04.51,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I am the king of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.31,0:32:09.85,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Whose warriors are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.42,0:32:13.22,Default,fe,0,0,0,,My guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.45,0:32:16.69,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Move away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.64,0:32:31.14,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.14,0:32:37.24,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Isn’t this treason?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.98,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Remove your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.21,0:32:43.42,Default,fe,0,0,0,,if you don’t want blood to be shed in Daejojon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.48,0:32:46.62,Default,fe,0,0,0,,If you command, Prince Yeonpyeong
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.62,0:32:49.99,Default,fe,0,0,0,,will happily get his hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.09,0:32:53.56,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I just have questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.76,0:32:55.93,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You came on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.03,0:33:01.93,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I did not order the investigation to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.84,0:33:08.17,Default,fe,0,0,0,,To whom does the Detective Department now report?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:16.21,Default,fe,0,0,0,,First I will study the matter myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.05,0:33:21.05,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And you can’t accuse the innocent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.05,0:33:24.32,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Only the queen is innocent here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.19,0:33:27.13,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.13,0:33:31.00,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Make her suffer,\Nand your life will also become torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.53,0:33:37.10,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I said that this was not a threat.\NBut I have to take my words back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:38.74,Default,fe,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.28,0:33:53.02,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This woman is no longer your cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.19,0:33:56.22,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Her happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.59,0:33:59.86,Default,fe,0,0,0,,sorrows and safety are now a concern
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:03.03,Default,fe,0,0,0,,not the head of the Detective Department - you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.56,0:34:05.23,Default,fe,0,0,0,,and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.27,0:34:12.67,Default,fe,0,0,0,,The Queen will be transported to her family's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.87,0:34:17.94,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Prepare the palanquin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.44,0:34:19.85,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.39,0:34:32.86,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.77,0:34:45.30,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.30,0:34:46.74,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You are so
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.74,0:34:49.84,Default,fe,0,0,0,,tried to hide this side of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.03,0:35:13.80,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Watch her carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.03,0:35:15.43,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.60,0:35:17.77,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Sorry for leaving you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.28,0:35:34.12,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Be on guard until you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.79,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And stand guard all night upon arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.79,0:35:38.29,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:57.78,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I bet that everyone except me will be able to exhale in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.18,0:36:01.55,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And why does this make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.22,0:36:07.85,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Wait, Kim Hwan should have been here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:11.69,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And here comes the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.13,0:36:16.63,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I was already worried that we wouldn’t see each other
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:18.50,Default,fe,0,0,0,,before I left...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.50,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.73,0:36:25.94,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Today I found a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.94,0:36:29.31,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This is Lee Senban.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:32.48,Default,fe,0,0,0,,We met when I was looking for my friend Lee Senman.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.11,0:36:37.05,Default,fe,0,0,0,,We are destined to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.62,0:36:39.75,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I wanted to have a drink with you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:42.05,Default,fe,0,0,0,,and play cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.59,0:36:44.99,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Do you want a tavern here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.22,0:36:48.46,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Drink and play cards? What kind of person are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:51.50,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What? That's what we do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.50,0:36:53.83,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Only you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:56.57,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Only for you, Kim Hwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.97,0:37:00.51,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-Only for you.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.11,0:37:04.28,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I didn’t know it was so easy to interest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.41,0:37:07.75,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Is it so easy for you to make friends?\NDo you have more of them than you could wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.75,0:37:10.25,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Apparently, I was one of your friends for the evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.25,0:37:13.49,Default,fe,0,0,0,,one of your many friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.35,0:37:49.59,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Well, did you send your friend Lee Senban home?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.59,0:37:51.32,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You are summoned to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.19,0:37:53.63,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.30,0:38:01.33,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Why is no one here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.93,0:38:06.61,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Has everyone gone to look\N at something interesting without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.17,0:38:12.14,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Feeling like everyone abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:24.52,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Lee Senman, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.52,0:38:26.86,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Finally met!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.30,0:38:34.93,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I was mistaken, I confused you with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.47,0:38:36.97,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.90,0:38:42.17,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I'm not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.54,0:38:45.21,Default,fe,0,0,0,,But I have something interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.25,0:38:56.89,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What are these things? They look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.89,0:38:58.42,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.56,0:39:03.16,Default,fe,0,0,0,,The curfew has not yet been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:05.86,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-Why are you on the street?\N-Hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.00,0:39:09.50,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.34,0:39:13.64,Default,fe,0,0,0,,One spanking wasn’t enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.64,0:39:15.71,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Are you selling books with obscenities again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:17.11,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Indecency?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.58,0:39:22.91,Default,fe,0,0,0,,He was the one who wanted to sell them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.65,0:39:25.28,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You are accused of violating morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.28,0:39:26.85,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.85,0:39:28.15,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.15,0:39:30.92,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-Wait, I...\N-Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.92,0:39:32.66,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-Wait.\N-Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.66,0:39:34.53,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-You can be more gentle.\N-Here is Herod.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.53,0:39:36.53,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Can you be gentler, I’m scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.53,0:39:40.10,Default,fe,0,0,0,,He asked specifically about the night after the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:42.67,Default,fe,0,0,0,,So the queen told him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:46.00,Default,fe,0,0,0,,It seemed strange to me that she was silent for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.00,0:39:48.64,Default,fe,0,0,0,,If he knew that I tried to kill her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.91,0:39:51.04,Default,fe,0,0,0,,one interrogation would not have ended the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.18,0:39:54.65,Default,fe,0,0,0,,On the day of his appointment, he read the saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.65,0:39:56.95,Default,fe,0,0,0,,"Saving the empire from discord,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.12,0:39:59.28,Default,fe,0,0,0,,power strikes fear into the king."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.28,0:40:00.82,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Self-confident turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.82,0:40:03.42,Default,fe,0,0,0,,He threatened to take away your throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:07.16,Default,fe,0,0,0,,If he's willing to go that far,\Nyou should have bitten your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.16,0:40:08.66,Default,fe,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.66,0:40:10.93,Default,fe,0,0,0,,he would have continued to put pressure on His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.13,0:40:13.40,Default,fe,0,0,0,,His Majesty would have revealed himself in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:14.97,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.90,0:40:18.40,Default,fe,0,0,0,,He must have found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.60,0:40:21.21,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I will find out how much he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.97,0:40:26.18,Default,fe,0,0,0,,For now we can only hope that the queen will wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.41,0:40:30.01,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This is the most important thing for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.01,0:40:31.35,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What about training?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.35,0:40:33.32,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin is hunting for our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.32,0:40:35.89,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Even more effort is needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:38.92,Default,fe,0,0,0,,There is very little time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.92,0:40:41.36,Default,fe,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.59,0:40:43.43,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Raise the lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:55.71,Default,fe,0,0,0,,How far is Her Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.77,0:40:56.81,Default,fe,0,0,0,,She's on her way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.81,0:40:59.31,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Are you sure she's not on the verge of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.88,0:41:01.68,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Yes, fortunately, everything worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.68,0:41:03.18,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.75,0:41:05.72,Default,fe,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.15,0:41:08.99,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Poisoned? How could she be poisoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.12,0:41:12.92,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I have already called the best doctors of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.59,0:41:15.06,Default,fe,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.39,0:41:18.20,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Be that as it may,\N you need to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:23.40,Default,fe,0,0,0,,You need to calm down and think rationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.67,0:41:26.07,Default,fe,0,0,0,,What is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.54,0:41:28.71,Default,fe,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.37,0:41:32.88,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.28,0:41:35.05,Default,fe,0,0,0,,How cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.08,0:41:37.12,Default,fe,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother's husband was poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.12,0:41:38.88,Default,fe,0,0,0,,How can you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.88,0:41:40.22,Default,fe,0,0,0,,The situation is difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.22,0:41:43.56,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Hwajin, stay away from the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.69,0:41:45.46,Default,fe,0,0,0,,This happened on the day of my visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:47.33,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I gave them an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.33,0:41:49.13,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Don't beat yourself up about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:51.56,Default,fe,0,0,0,,They would have made their move anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.10,0:41:53.53,Default,fe,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.37,0:41:57.50,Default,fe,0,0,0,,why did you move the queen back to her father’s house?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.50,0:41:59.84,Default,fe,0,0,0,,She must have been lonely in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.87,0:42:02.24,Default,fe,0,0,0,,In a dream she called her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.34,0:42:06.78,Default,fe,0,0,0,,But Her Majesty dreamed of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.71,0:42:09.11,Default,fe,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.31,0:42:11.12,Default,fe,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.55,0:42:16.72,Default,fe,0,0,0,,-No.\N-Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.75,0:42:19.99,Default,fe,0,0,0,,I will send my brother as soon as everything is decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:27.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.84,0:42:36.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.54,0:42:38.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Will you go against the will of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.78,0:42:46.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please don’t get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.89,0:42:50.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.44,0:43:07.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Now that you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.24,0:43:10.81,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,it’s like we’ve gone back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.28,0:43:14.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.55,0:43:22.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Only you are looking for me when I run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.65,0:43:24.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I won’t let you lose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.96,0:43:28.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.66,0:43:34.90,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,If only I could go back to that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.24,0:43:43.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.18,0:43:51.45,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,You should have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.05,0:43:56.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I am yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.34,0:44:46.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you even know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.17,0:44:49.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The same Kim Hwan who is about to become an official
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.61,0:44:50.88,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.88,0:44:52.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It wasn’t enough what he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.71,0:44:54.25,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,decided to bargain with your future appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.25,0:44:55.31,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bargain?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.31,0:44:57.42,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I am a righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.28,0:45:00.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Really by face and talents
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.79,0:45:04.09,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,can’t you see that I’m Sungkyunkwan’s student?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.12,0:45:07.49,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I will not suffer injustice...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.49,0:45:09.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Be quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.69,0:45:11.50,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Look, what a talkative guy you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.50,0:45:14.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How dare you? If you let me go immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.43,0:45:17.04,Default,Spiky,0,0,0,,I’ll give you five nyans in silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.10,0:45:18.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Or you can
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.91,0:45:22.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,give them to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.91,0:45:27.15,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,In return, we will teach you an invaluable lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.19,0:45:38.19,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,As soon as you hear what I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.83,0:45:44.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,you will no longer be what you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:48.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You will become truly mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.35,0:46:07.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Are you going to the palace? \N-Yes. Have you just returned home?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.92,0:46:10.19,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I heard what happened between you and the king yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.19,0:46:12.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.52,0:46:14.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Even if he doesn’t look great,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.69,0:46:18.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,if you put so much pressure on him, he will become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.03,0:46:20.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why did you act without my order?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.36,0:46:21.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:24.07,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,His eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.37,0:46:28.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,He has the eyes of a man hiding his aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.21,0:46:34.78,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I didn't want the dowager queen to worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:37.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,so he acted rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:40.38,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.99,0:46:43.39,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.96,0:46:50.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Did you find out how the queen is doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.63,0:46:53.06,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,I heard that the crisis is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.06,0:46:55.87,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,She hasn’t come to her senses yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.07,0:46:58.90,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,But it will get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.34,0:47:02.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Do you want to say anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.37,0:47:04.64,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I heard the dowager queen
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.64,0:47:06.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,mentioned the deposition of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.34,0:47:08.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,She said this in a fit of anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.61,0:47:10.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,In fact, she doesn’t want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.18,0:47:12.48,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.05,0:47:16.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I know very well how you care about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.89,0:47:18.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maybe not as much as you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.52,0:47:21.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but I also take good care of her, so don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.93,0:47:24.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.60,0:47:26.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,See you in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:50.09,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The queen's father sent gifts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.89,0:47:53.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How is the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.66,0:47:55.49,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The crisis is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.49,0:47:58.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but she needs rest for now,\Nso she returned home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.23,0:48:00.60,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,She is constantly sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.90,0:48:02.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,She has never recovered from that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.97,0:48:04.67,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What should I call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.97,0:48:06.90,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,She’s broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.21,0:48:09.81,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,I'm trying to let her get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.81,0:48:13.51,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,but she suddenly becomes a vegetable. \NShe's too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:16.78,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,What if Concubine Cho gives birth to a prince first?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.78,0:48:18.82,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Then the Queen Mother will rebel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.82,0:48:20.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.45,0:48:23.22,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,I have prepared a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.45,0:48:24.72,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Backup plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.72,0:48:27.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I made sure that the other two,\Nwhom we were considering for the role of queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:29.79,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,they didn’t marry anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.79,0:48:33.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are a reliable brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.40,0:48:39.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I heard that yesterday Benin accused the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.54,0:48:44.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yesterday everyone behaved strangely towards the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.41,0:48:48.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,As if the king was hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.65,0:48:52.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This king is different from the deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.92,0:48:55.35,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,That’s how it should be. You chose it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.35,0:48:58.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I elevated the king to his place for only one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.99,0:49:02.56,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So that you don’t have to make painful decisions,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.56,0:49:04.90,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,as it was under the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.93,0:49:06.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.73,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It was quite painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:12.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I defended the country at the cost of my grandson’s blood
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.24,0:49:14.07,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.47,0:49:16.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And if someone dares to destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:19.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,he will not be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.45,0:49:25.82,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Detective department.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.30,0:50:15.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-First you must.\N-No, you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.70,0:50:18.44,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No, you're first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.47,0:50:49.17,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.70,0:50:52.60,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,In Joseon or in Korea?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.94,0:51:00.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,In Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.88,0:51:05.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can’t say that I’m glad, because I lost them,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.12,0:51:08.42,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but I can’t say that I’m sad, because I’m glad that I can check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.55,0:51:13.02,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why does everything sparkle so much here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.64,0:51:34.55,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Gold of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.68,0:51:36.45,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Inky?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.75,0:51:41.22,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.82,0:51:46.79,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It seemed to me that I was in some other place.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.76,0:51:50.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Finally, you woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.00,0:51:52.63,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s like deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.63,0:51:54.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Just let's go without fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.53,0:51:59.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But you almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.24,0:52:01.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,They even stopped breathing completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.97,0:52:04.71,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Don’t cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.64,0:52:07.14,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Stopped breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.38,0:52:09.68,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,According to the royal physician,\Nyou were without a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.68,0:52:11.98,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,As if you had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.92,0:52:15.09,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.49,0:52:17.42,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.52,0:52:20.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.53,0:52:22.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.76,0:52:24.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can’t avoid meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.66,0:52:27.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,with someone you shouldn’t meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.06,0:52:29.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-What? \N-So, no difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.93,0:52:32.34,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,but there is someone with whom I don’t feel comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.84,0:52:35.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The one who, in essence, is my real enemy -
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.61,0:52:38.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,father of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.71,0:52:40.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.71,0:52:43.58,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-What happiness, queen. \N-Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.58,0:52:47.69,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you okay? Can you breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.69,0:52:50.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What do you order? Should I call the royal physician?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.29,0:52:53.06,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It looks like you are about to lose consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.19,0:52:55.69,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Here, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.69,0:52:57.23,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.06,0:53:00.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,These are herbs for restoring yin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.53,0:53:02.10,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.30,0:53:05.20,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Why are you so sweaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.84,0:53:09.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Holy heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.34,0:53:12.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.28,0:53:15.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I didn’t sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.08,0:53:16.35,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Losing my appetite completely
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.35,0:53:18.52,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,and I haven’t eaten anything for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:22.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Every time I get up, my head is spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.39,0:53:24.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-You must be deeply shocked. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.72,0:53:27.19,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The root of diseases is worries and troubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.19,0:53:28.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,you need to rest and calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.99,0:53:31.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, I will do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.96,0:53:34.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I hope you feel better soon. It's time for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.33,0:53:36.23,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.23,0:53:37.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.57,0:53:39.74,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Holy saints.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.74,0:53:42.71,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I can’t do that. I have to show respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.94,0:53:44.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.41,0:53:46.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wow. What are you doing? You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.84,0:53:48.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No, no, I don’t dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.51,0:53:50.92,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please accept my bow, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.92,0:53:54.39,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.65,0:53:57.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.96,0:53:59.52,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.19,0:54:03.03,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let me bow to you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.06,0:54:04.60,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.63,0:54:07.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Being a queen in Joseon is so uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.43,0:54:09.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let me, while I’m here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.33,0:54:13.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,to be just your daughter Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.21,0:54:19.84,Default,end of shooting range,0,0,0,,The higher the position, the stronger the loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.71,0:54:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.61,0:54:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.55,0:54:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.62,0:54:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.52,0:54:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.56,0:54:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.29,0:54:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.87,0:54:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you decorated the room,\N it still seemed empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.11,0:54:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But as soon as you returned, the room began to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.15,0:54:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.68,0:55:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The room is so bright that it blinds your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.89,0:55:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.52,0:55:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, nothing will tarnish your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.80,0:55:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have prepared all the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.84,0:55:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.17,0:55:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t see a single doctor there,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.64,0:56:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and there’s a whole crowd here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.25,0:56:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone else supposed to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.29,0:56:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Some kind of holiday?\N-This is breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.10,0:56:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To restore strength
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.56,0:56:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,your father prepared you turtle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.20,0:56:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.17,0:56:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtles since the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.84,0:56:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.08,0:56:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.35,0:56:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.93,0:56:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It is such an honor to serve you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:56:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She is the best beauty master in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.07,0:57:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am naturally beautiful. I don't need her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.11,0:57:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.75,0:57:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Call for overthrow and poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.92,0:57:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They are doing everything to get rid of Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.06,0:57:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.23,0:57:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard they try to harm Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.80,0:57:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I will increase my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.57,0:57:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With a brother like you, she has nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.98,0:57:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with this material?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.25,0:57:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ordinary silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.42,0:57:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.32,0:57:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you given someone clothes made from this material?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.36,0:58:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After Her Majesty became Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.37,0:58:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I only received gifts, I didn’t give them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.07,0:58:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person I offer gifts to is the Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.34,0:58:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.21,0:58:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.78,0:58:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My warehouse has been robbed twice recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.85,0:58:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That silk could be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.12,0:58:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Has your home been attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.66,0:58:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.09,0:58:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It is dangerous to keep all your valuables in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.89,0:58:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It is better to place them in different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.56,0:58:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have several warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.40,0:58:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But the robbers chose only those with the most valuable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.44,0:58:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about it, my neck immediately goes numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.31,0:58:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.35,0:58:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible to find out among the stolen
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.85,0:58:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,was this silk or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.12,0:58:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.79,0:59:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And keeping records of valuable property was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.19,0:59:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.90,0:59:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell anyone about the warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.20,0:59:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not good if people find out about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.57,0:59:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.67,0:59:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But you haven’t heard anything strange from your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.38,0:59:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.15,0:59:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole situation with Her Majesty: saved the king with his concubine
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.69,0:59:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and ruined relations with the dowager queen - worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.26,0:59:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nightmares in which she is overthrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.96,0:59:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Overthrown? Why are you thinking about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.50,0:59:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are rumors that one of the contenders for queen
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.30,0:59:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,delivered a secret message.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.34,0:59:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that they want to choose a new queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.88,0:59:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried that I've been overeating these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They will not abandon Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.32,1:00:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.99,1:00:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I should try and send\N more gifts to the Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.23,1:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.03,1:00:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.80,1:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing. I'll be there soon...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.37,1:00:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, maybe not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.91,1:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.18,1:00:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot that I was no longer young, and was careless.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.52,1:00:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t have time for fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.37,1:00:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.60,1:00:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like a doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.64,1:00:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.74,1:01:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it, don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.80,1:01:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This book is already overgrown with mold.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.61,1:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Horrible stench.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.31,1:01:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were a man,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.98,1:01:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,would enter the palace after passing the state exam.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.45,1:01:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You really enjoyed studying.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.42,1:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who liked to study this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.32,1:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried only for my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.69,1:01:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom died, giving me life.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.39,1:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I decided that I had to pay back for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.66,1:01:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently that’s why you even at night
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.73,1:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we studied hard on our birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.88,1:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.55,1:02:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.86,1:02:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because on my birthday we remembered my mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.83,1:02:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never smiled.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.27,1:02:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.54,1:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.48,1:02:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories are returning!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.81,1:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What are these memories that seem to be mine, but not really?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.96,1:02:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Chanhyuk
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.93,1:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.30,1:03:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.33,1:03:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Chanhyuk, current Minister of War.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.77,1:03:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Collected with a group of military
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.34,1:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,excessively high war tax.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.34,1:03:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Seok-kyn, current left advisor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.31,1:03:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Responsible for finances,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.68,1:03:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,via the grain exchange
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.25,1:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,appropriates royal gifts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.02,1:03:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byung-hak, current state councilor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.69,1:03:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tax criminal:
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.29,1:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,conspired with local governors
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.76,1:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and taxed the empty lands.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.40,1:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Mungeun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.60,1:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.57,1:03:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.24,1:03:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Father of the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.11,1:03:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,head of the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.68,1:03:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Famous manufacturer,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.38,1:03:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing with everything from rice loans to the war tax system.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.89,1:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.49,1:04:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Current troop commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.74,1:04:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At the peak of its power,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.04,1:04:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who founded this whole corrupt system.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.85,1:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.52,1:04:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.17,1:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the palace has a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.11,1:04:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret hidden by lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.38,1:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret that cannot be seen or heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.95,1:05:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret waiting for the right moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.12,1:05:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep a secret deep in the heart,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.76,1:05:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.93,1:05:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Initial instruction for children
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.50,1:05:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we all wear masks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.81,1:05:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.22,1:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But a secret
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.99,1:06:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,will definitely open.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.06,1:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.30,1:06:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.18,1:06:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your Majesty, your memories have returned!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.99,1:06:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything is confused. Go away, woman, go away!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.39,1:06:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do you keep getting weirder and weirder?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.43,1:06:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's something I haven't told anyone about.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.03,1:06:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Help.\N-That damp smell.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.93,1:06:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Many warehouses have been robbed in the capital recently.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.87,1:07:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-So what?\N-I'm interested,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.57,1:07:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}maybe this is how you make money.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.94,1:07:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today we will clarify everything.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.71,1:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is what I was waiting for.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.02,Default,lily,0,0,0,,A condition when there is a pulse, but the person is barely breathing.
